All the documentation for Armagetron is now in the doc/ directory and in HTML.
Starting point is, of course, doc/index.html.
The directory is usually located in /usr/local/games/armagetronad.

This branch (webgl) also builds the game as a WebAssembly/WebGL application
that runs in the browser: see webgl/README.md and
https://smarioman.github.io/armagetronad/ .
